    description: "deep-20260406-182616 reflect: 5 of 101 dispatches_to edges in alertmanager are still concrete->concrete (4.95%): InclusiveRange.{memberFromString,MarshalText,MarshalYAML,UnmarshalYAML} in timeinterval/timeinterval.go and URL.UnmarshalYAML -> mailDev.UnmarshalYAML. These are all in the same file with identical method names across sibling structs — distinct from the cross-package class-ID collision PR #2721 fixed. Likely a within-file type-hierarchy artifact (multiple structs in one file all defining MarshalYAML create N x N edges). Investigate whether type-hierarchy linker creates spurious edges for sibling structs that don't share inheritance."  # 3d60
